# =========================
# Skill IP (T029-T031)
# =========================
# Plaintext skill files are git-ignored (server-side IP, never committed)
# Only the encrypted .enc files are committed
BD-Lead-Research-SKILL-v06.md
backend/app/skills/*.source.md
backend/app/skills/bd_lead_research.source.md
# Allow .enc files to be committed (they are encrypted, safe):
!backend/app/skills/*.enc
!backend/app/skills/bd_lead_research.md.enc

